        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia  #12S Lever with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a contemporary pairing of the  modern Square Rose and Omnia's most popular stainless lever, the <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-door-lever-set-omnia-12\">Omnia #12 stainless steel lever</a>. The mounting screws are concealed for a clean, contemporary look. Omnia's Stainless Steel leversets are designed to enhance any setting where a contemporary, modern look is desired. This leverset is strong, durable, and made from premium grade stainless steel that proves worthy of Omnia's exceptional high-end standards. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-55537-SM.jpg?v=1704354521\" width=\"326\" height=\"177\" border=\"0\" alt=\"OMN 12S Lever Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/omnia-12s-stainless-steel-entry-lever-set-with-square-deadbolt-omnia-12s-d9000saus32d\"><b>Omnia #12S Entry Door Lever Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-door-lever-set-omnia-12\"><b>Omnia #12 Lever with Round Rose</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Contemporary Square Rose Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia #12S Square Rose Stainless Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li> \r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction </li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Door Lever Set With Square Rose, Omnia  #12S",
                "description": "This is a contemporary pairing of the modern Square Rose and Omnia's most popular stainless lever, the Omnia #12 stainless steel lever. The mounting screws are concealed for a clean, contemporary look. Omnia's Stainless Steel leversets are designed to enhance any setting where a contemporary, modern look is desired. This leverset is strong, durable, and made from premium grade stainless steel that proves worthy of Omnia's exceptional high-end standards. \r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-12S Omnia #12S Contemporary Square Rose Levers, Omnia  #12 Stainless Steel Levers, Omnia Number 12 Stainless Steel, contemporary Stainless Steel Leverset, OMN-12S stainless steel levers with sguare roses, Omnia  #12S stainless levers, stainless steel handle  lever set, contemporary door hardware, door locks, contemporary stainless steel locks,  contemporary stainless steel locks, omnia door hardware, Omnia Modern Square Rose Levers,"
